! STRAY with local and global components at second order: stray_field_matrix() on the host, the matrix
! on the device through track_particles() (the global components need the floor coordinates). Must be identical
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
ST: STRAY, L=0.5, LBX=1e-5, LBY=-2e-5, GBX=3e-5, GBY=1e-5, GBZ=2e-5, ORDER=2
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, ST, D)
